WEBVTT

00:06.780 --> 00:10.110
What the heck is this?!

00:11.190 --> 00:15.500
I wonder how many rooms there are like this.

00:16.310 --> 00:20.000
After the events of the previous episode, 
I've been moved to new quarters.

00:20.000 --> 00:22.130
There are several of them, my lady.

00:22.600 --> 00:27.880
It's said they were meant to hold nobles
 that would betray the crown.

00:28.190 --> 00:31.510
So I'm being treated like a traitor, am I?

00:32.030 --> 00:36.620
It does not appear, however, that anyone 
ever reached heaven here in these rooms.

00:36.620 --> 00:40.540
You mean people died in that other room?

00:40.540 --> 00:42.570
What's all this about? Sounds amusing!

00:42.570 --> 00:43.940
It does not in any way!

00:43.940 --> 00:46.110
If you see any ghosts, 
be sure to tell me, okay?

00:46.590 --> 00:48.610
Also, you were moved here

00:48.610 --> 00:52.160
because you broke a window 
and tried to flee, right?

00:52.160 --> 00:53.930
You brought this on yourself.

00:55.910 --> 00:59.680
Yeah, but more importantly, 
what are you doing here?

01:00.040 --> 01:04.750
When the future crown princess was detained, 
I was asked to be her conversation partner.

01:05.130 --> 01:07.280
Why? No need. Go away.

01:07.280 --> 01:10.950
Well, they're employing me,
so I'm not leaving until my work is done.

01:10.950 --> 01:12.620
They actually hired you?

01:12.620 --> 01:16.010
The prince is paying me oodles for this.

01:16.010 --> 01:17.480
You swindled him?

01:17.480 --> 01:19.260
What a horrible thing to say.

01:19.260 --> 01:20.850
Don't try to put this on me!

01:20.850 --> 01:22.550
Listen up.

01:22.550 --> 01:25.190
The most important thing 
in this world is money.

01:25.460 --> 01:26.550
Hmph!

01:26.550 --> 01:29.690
Maria, cover your ears! 
You mustn't listen to her!

01:29.690 --> 01:32.640
The most important thing 
in the world is money, is it not?

01:33.660 --> 01:35.590
My goodness.

01:36.570 --> 01:39.500
That is very useful advice, Lady Brianna.

01:40.820 --> 01:45.290
Mmm, yummy! The royal family 
really does have refined taste.

01:45.290 --> 01:48.050
Is your job eating snacks now?

01:48.050 --> 01:52.290
Oh, don't be rude. My work here goes 
beyond mere small talk.

01:53.310 --> 01:54.300
Ta-da!

01:54.300 --> 01:56.470
Hmm? What's that?

01:56.470 --> 01:59.330
"Overcoming Princess Lessons for

01:59.750 --> 02:01.200
Love."

03:35.790 --> 03:37.810
"That will not do."

03:38.390 --> 03:42.240
The words stung like a bucket 
of ice-cold water dumped on her head.

03:42.240 --> 03:44.990
Trembling, Leticia slowly looked up

03:44.990 --> 03:49.000
to see the tutor staring down at her 
with chilling, piercing eyes.

03:49.000 --> 03:52.410
Leticia pursed her lips tightly and then said,

03:52.410 --> 03:54.170
"I beg your pardon."

03:54.550 --> 03:57.600
Leticia's lady-in-waiting rushed to her side.

03:57.600 --> 03:58.880
"Please stop!

03:59.250 --> 04:02.890
If this continues, it will take 
a physical toll on my mistress."

04:02.890 --> 04:08.480
"A girl too weak to withstand princess 
lessons is not fit to become queen.

04:08.480 --> 04:11.960
Her Majesty must be strong of mind and body."

04:11.960 --> 04:13.350
"Even so..."

04:13.350 --> 04:16.750
As the lady-in-waiting continued 
to challenge the tutor's scathing words,

04:16.750 --> 04:19.740
Leticia turned to her with a gentle smile.

04:19.740 --> 04:23.260
"Thank you, but I'll be all right."

04:23.660 --> 04:27.750
Leticia waveringly arose, as if searching 
her body for the strength to stand.

04:27.750 --> 04:29.490
"My lady..."

04:29.490 --> 04:35.130
Her lady-in-waiting beheld Leticia
 sympathetically as tears welled in her eyes.

04:35.130 --> 04:38.340
Leticia stood with her head held high 
before the harsh tutor.

04:38.340 --> 04:41.380
"I will show her that 
I can overcome any difficulty

04:41.380 --> 04:44.910
in order to wed my beloved
 Prince Clarke one day!"

04:49.830 --> 04:51.600
What a farce.

04:51.600 --> 04:56.780
Oh, just listen to you. This romance novel 
is the talk of the town right now.

04:56.780 --> 05:01.490
Is this illustration meant to be Prince Clarke
and the missus? How wonderful!

05:01.490 --> 05:03.820
Why does a book like that even exist?

05:03.820 --> 05:05.960
All thanks to me, naturally.

05:05.960 --> 05:06.740
Wuh?

05:07.290 --> 05:11.930
I've been spreading through high society
how grueling princess lessons really are.

05:11.930 --> 05:14.080
Per direct request of His Highness.

05:14.360 --> 05:16.390
Why would he want you to do that?

05:16.390 --> 05:17.920
To manipulate public opinion.

05:17.920 --> 05:21.440
Obviously, he wants people to have 
a positive impression of his fiancée.

05:21.440 --> 05:23.190
As a result, they now see you

05:23.190 --> 05:26.300
as a brave maiden who endured 
brutal princess lessons

05:26.300 --> 05:28.310
for the sake of love.

05:28.590 --> 05:30.430
That's ridiculous.

05:30.430 --> 05:33.520
The whole kingdom is in 
pro-wedding mode right now.

05:33.520 --> 05:37.990
Scarcely a soul is opposed to the idea
 of you becoming princess.

05:37.990 --> 05:39.690
I'm so pleased to hear that!

05:39.690 --> 05:42.740
My lovely Maria, could I have another cup?

05:42.740 --> 05:44.730
Yes, Lady Brianna.

05:44.730 --> 05:46.530
I'm not pleased one bit!

05:47.260 --> 05:49.660
I just want my freedom.

05:50.010 --> 05:52.300
Well, you'd better learn to accept it.

05:52.300 --> 05:56.000
No matter how far you run, 
the prince will come chasing after you.

05:56.000 --> 05:58.730
That's probably true, but still...

05:58.730 --> 06:00.500
You've sure got commitment issues.

06:00.500 --> 06:02.940
It's not a matter of commitment.

06:02.940 --> 06:06.380
Here's the real question. The prince aside,

06:06.380 --> 06:11.460
could you give up these delicious meals
 and a toasty bed to return to every day?

06:11.460 --> 06:14.830
You've really got a great life here.

06:16.870 --> 06:18.170
Pardon me.

06:28.860 --> 06:32.100
There's no way I could pull it off 
as perfectly as you...

06:32.100 --> 06:35.040
Even other women would fall for your charm.

06:35.040 --> 06:38.710
Anyone can learn this much 
after ten years of lessons.

06:38.710 --> 06:41.350
I'd never last ten years.

06:41.350 --> 06:45.700
I took the lessons for a bit, but they were 
so unbearable I wanted to scream.

06:45.700 --> 06:47.220
Is that so?

06:47.590 --> 06:51.500
Even Catherine and Isabella, 
who went to nursery since they were kids,

06:51.500 --> 06:53.610
said they were horrible.

06:53.610 --> 06:55.390
Even they did?

06:56.310 --> 06:57.350
Missus?

06:58.260 --> 07:01.530
Come on, what is it? 
You're acting like a child.

07:01.530 --> 07:04.420
Quit being such a spoiled brat already.

07:05.220 --> 07:06.830
It's not about that.

07:07.910 --> 07:10.330
I've never had my freedom.

07:10.330 --> 07:13.950
I was forced into an engagement 
that didn't even make sense to me

07:13.950 --> 07:17.710
and was always sequestered. 
I've never even been in love.

07:18.390 --> 07:21.210
I can't stand the idea 
of marrying someone I don't love.

07:21.690 --> 07:25.720
Lady, do you even know 
what it means to be in love?

07:26.950 --> 07:31.640
I don't, okay? But I want
 to decide how I live my life!

07:32.020 --> 07:35.520
Yeah, that's what I mean. Do you know how 
privileged that makes you sound?

07:35.940 --> 07:38.770
Wuh? What a harsh comeback!

07:39.600 --> 07:42.440
Missus, would you like another cup?

07:42.440 --> 07:44.050
I certainly would.

07:44.050 --> 07:45.900
My, this is delicious!

07:51.160 --> 07:53.710
What am I supposed to do now?

07:53.710 --> 07:55.950
Why are you lying around like that?

07:56.290 --> 07:58.040
Does it really matter?

07:58.040 --> 07:59.590
When did you get back?

07:59.590 --> 08:00.800
A little while ago.

08:00.800 --> 08:02.150
Don't act so slovenly.

08:02.890 --> 08:06.060
Wuh? Oh, it's from Mother!

08:07.450 --> 08:12.260
She's very much looking forward to 
the day you become the crown princess.

08:12.260 --> 08:14.990
It sure sounds like it. How's Lily?

08:14.990 --> 08:16.990
She's working diligently.

08:16.990 --> 08:18.640
And everyone in the village?

08:18.640 --> 08:20.550
It's as peaceful as ever.

08:20.550 --> 08:22.020
How is Father doing?

08:22.020 --> 08:25.690
He's planning to buy a new horse before long.

08:25.690 --> 08:29.270
I'm jealous. I wish I could go 
back to the Dorman estate.

08:29.270 --> 08:30.610
Not a chance.

08:30.610 --> 08:33.660
Then at least let me move 
back into my old room!

08:33.660 --> 08:35.790
Not. Happening.

08:35.790 --> 08:38.840
Then... Wuh? What is this?

08:38.840 --> 08:40.240
Take a guess.

08:40.240 --> 08:41.420
Huh?

08:45.520 --> 08:47.690
Mother's muffins!

08:47.690 --> 08:49.180
That is correct.

08:49.180 --> 08:52.760
She wanted to treat you, so she 
stepped back into the kitchen for once.

08:53.270 --> 08:54.750
Oh, Mother.

08:54.750 --> 08:55.940
However...

08:55.940 --> 08:56.770
Wuh?

08:57.420 --> 08:59.770
I was involved in making them.

09:00.960 --> 09:02.150
You don't mean...

09:03.510 --> 09:05.650
death muffin roulette?!

09:06.200 --> 09:08.400
Why don't we play a little game?

09:08.670 --> 09:10.280
I was hoping you would ask.

09:10.910 --> 09:13.280
Rock, paper...

09:10.910 --> 09:13.280
Rock, paper...

09:13.280 --> 09:14.530
scissors!

09:13.280 --> 09:14.530
scissors!

09:14.940 --> 09:16.700
You'd better not look...

09:16.700 --> 09:18.170
thataway!

09:19.560 --> 09:22.040
I win! I get to go first!

09:22.040 --> 09:24.870
You're always so underhanded!

09:25.540 --> 09:27.710
You're the one who taught me, Brother.

09:33.840 --> 09:34.970
Hurry it up!

09:34.970 --> 09:37.310
Okay, this one.

09:37.830 --> 09:39.310
Your turn, dear Brother.

09:41.960 --> 09:43.750
I can feel you, my muffin.

09:45.540 --> 09:47.940
Don't be gross. Hurry up.

09:47.940 --> 09:49.080
Tch.

09:49.470 --> 09:50.740
This one, then.

09:54.320 --> 09:57.950
Yummy! I can tell this is mother's recipe!

09:58.710 --> 10:00.330
They're just plain good.

10:00.330 --> 10:03.720
Then we're not done yet!

10:03.720 --> 10:05.580
Now things get interesting.

10:09.830 --> 10:10.880
Yummy!

10:09.830 --> 10:10.880
Yum.

10:12.200 --> 10:13.970
I think it's the one on the right.

10:13.970 --> 10:16.500
Or maybe it just looks that way. 
So the left?

10:16.900 --> 10:19.070
Hey, make up your mind!

10:19.070 --> 10:21.270
I'm about to! Hold your horses!

10:22.780 --> 10:26.240
Not only have you never ever 
had good observational skills,

10:26.240 --> 10:30.190
but you're also indecisive and have 
a bad habit of choosing poorly.

10:30.560 --> 10:33.290
Keep the input to yourself. 
Let me concentrate.

10:33.290 --> 10:35.190
On top of all that, you're stubborn.

10:36.830 --> 10:39.630
To choose right or to choose left, 
that is the question.

10:39.630 --> 10:41.520
Security is mortals' chiefest enemy.

10:41.520 --> 10:43.960
Where doth my light beguile?

10:47.250 --> 10:49.850
Nothing ventured, nothing gained.

10:49.850 --> 10:52.940
Hey, that's the one I was going to take!

10:52.940 --> 10:54.800
Early bird catches the worm.

10:56.680 --> 10:58.880
I'm sure this is the bad one!

10:58.880 --> 11:01.140
Come on, quit dawdling.

11:01.140 --> 11:03.600
Okay! What happens, happens!

11:09.260 --> 11:10.740
It's so spicy!

11:13.210 --> 11:15.530
Mother's the only winner this time...

11:20.150 --> 11:23.160
She sure fooled us. That's just like her.

11:24.820 --> 11:27.250
I'm glad this seems to have cheered you up.

11:27.570 --> 11:28.900
Brother...

11:29.480 --> 11:31.700
But it's still burning.

11:31.700 --> 11:34.630
You're right. Maria!

11:36.040 --> 11:39.320
Well then, missus, good night.

11:42.830 --> 11:46.870
Now that there's nobody around to stop me, 
there's only one thing left to do.

11:46.870 --> 11:51.310
Yes! Time to pick myself up 
and embark on my great escape!

11:52.750 --> 11:56.570
How foolish to leave me alone again. 
They sure do underestimate me!

12:02.010 --> 12:04.850
For some reason, my heart's racing!

12:06.010 --> 12:08.170
Up we go.

12:11.820 --> 12:15.050
A normal ol' storage space? 
Seems useful, though.

12:15.560 --> 12:19.030
Let's see. Maybe the bookcase, then...

12:20.200 --> 12:22.810
They're all really old books.

12:24.250 --> 12:28.190
Huh? "Prince Clarke's Diary"?

12:28.970 --> 12:34.190
Wait, I'm sure that's bad news. 
Undoubtedly best just to ignore it.

12:37.030 --> 12:38.700
But I can't resist!

12:40.760 --> 12:41.610
Hmm?

12:43.910 --> 12:44.760
Huh?

12:44.760 --> 12:45.950
Wh-Wha?!

12:46.840 --> 12:47.990
Wuh?!

12:51.760 --> 12:55.460
Wow! What a cool contraption!

13:00.320 --> 13:03.850
Straight out of an adventure novel! 
Perfect for a castle.

13:04.210 --> 13:05.310
Just to be safe...

13:09.860 --> 13:11.640
Good! All clear.

13:13.400 --> 13:14.580
All right!

13:14.580 --> 13:16.210
Good evening, Lettie.

13:16.210 --> 13:20.350
Gulp! Huh? W-Wuh?

13:24.320 --> 13:25.990
Prince Clarke?

13:26.340 --> 13:29.960
How naughty of you to toss my diary like that.

13:31.690 --> 13:33.440
I'm done for.

13:44.590 --> 13:46.970
I thought you'd show up much sooner.

13:46.970 --> 13:49.720
Your Highness, what are you doing here?

13:50.220 --> 13:54.470
I was certain you would eventually 
discover the hidden door, Lettie.

13:54.970 --> 13:56.960
So I moved to this room and waited.

13:56.960 --> 13:58.940
Why would you do such a thing?

13:58.940 --> 14:03.040
Isn't it best if my darling Lettie comes 
to see me on her own?

14:03.440 --> 14:06.110
Plus, you seem to have taken
an interest in my diary.

14:06.110 --> 14:07.990
I wouldn't say that...

14:07.990 --> 14:11.250
I bet you wanted to learn
more about me, didn't you?

14:11.550 --> 14:15.130
Um, I should be getting back to my room...

14:15.420 --> 14:16.940
Oh, there's no rush.

14:21.460 --> 14:22.440
Wuh?

14:22.440 --> 14:24.420
Hey! Wai—

14:24.420 --> 14:25.390
Here.

14:34.070 --> 14:36.850
Lettie, open your eyes.

14:38.020 --> 14:41.110
Lettie, you truly are adorable.

14:46.860 --> 14:49.240
Let me go!

14:49.240 --> 14:52.000
Ah, Lettie! Wait! Just a... Ouch!

14:52.000 --> 14:52.780
Hup!

14:54.680 --> 14:57.250
Trying to produce heirs when 
we're not even married?!

14:57.250 --> 14:58.340
You're totally...

14:58.340 --> 14:59.340
Lettie?

14:59.340 --> 15:01.570
...shameless!

15:02.070 --> 15:03.010
Oof!

15:07.280 --> 15:08.640
Lettie?

15:12.770 --> 15:15.360
Actually, I believe...

15:15.360 --> 15:19.430
we shouldn't consummate our marriage 
until we're formally wed.

15:19.870 --> 15:21.270
That's been my dream, anyway.

15:21.270 --> 15:26.170
Huh! So that's been your dream 
this whole time, has it?!

15:26.170 --> 15:27.170
Yes.

15:27.170 --> 15:32.160
So I'll wait until after the ceremony. 
I put your feelings first, Lettie.

15:32.160 --> 15:34.570
Oh, what a relief.

15:34.570 --> 15:35.310
But...

15:35.310 --> 15:36.080
Wuh?

15:36.870 --> 15:39.630
I can't completely turn off 
how I feel about you.

15:39.980 --> 15:43.250
So please allow me this one thing.

15:43.810 --> 15:46.510
Prince Clarke?

15:48.430 --> 15:49.260
Hmm?

15:50.730 --> 15:53.850
I've always dreamed of snuggling 
with you like this too!

15:54.190 --> 15:58.310
Words can't express everything. 
It's important to <i>show</i> love too!

15:58.310 --> 16:00.060
Eh...

16:00.060 --> 16:01.670
Oh, you're a good, good girl!

16:01.670 --> 16:03.100
Oh, you're such a good, good girl!

16:03.100 --> 16:05.630
Here, Lettie! Good girl, good girl!

16:14.140 --> 16:15.650
This turned out perfect.

16:15.650 --> 16:17.120
It certainly was heavy!

16:17.120 --> 16:19.590
Thanks for lending me a hand, Maria.

16:19.590 --> 16:21.900
Now I can sleep in peace.

16:21.900 --> 16:23.590
I am pleased to hear that.

16:23.590 --> 16:27.090
However, why was this necessary?

16:27.090 --> 16:29.270
Huh? Uh...

16:30.350 --> 16:33.760
What?! Prince Clarke is in the next room?

16:33.760 --> 16:35.030
Yeah, he is.

16:35.030 --> 16:36.470
How wonderful!

16:36.470 --> 16:37.610
No, it isn't!

16:37.610 --> 16:40.950
Two engaged lovebirds using a hidden door 
for a secret rendezvous...

16:40.950 --> 16:43.020
Doesn't that sound romantic?

16:43.020 --> 16:46.110
What part? I'm not interested at all!

16:46.560 --> 16:47.940
It's love.

16:48.380 --> 16:53.200
I don't care! I can't physically take that 
kind of affection night after night.

16:53.200 --> 16:54.600
What kind?

16:54.600 --> 16:55.710
Never mind.

16:56.980 --> 16:57.840
Hmm?

17:07.830 --> 17:09.050
Did it stop?

17:10.100 --> 17:11.520
I've beaten him!

17:11.960 --> 17:13.720
I've finally beaten him!

17:13.720 --> 17:17.020
He must be seething with frustration right now.

17:21.100 --> 17:22.790
Hi, Lettie.

17:23.580 --> 17:24.480
Huh?

17:24.750 --> 17:26.620
You just walked right in?!

17:27.310 --> 17:31.450
You seem quite pleased with yourself. 
May I ask what you've been up to?

17:31.450 --> 17:33.950
Well, um...

17:33.950 --> 17:35.160
What is that doing there?

17:35.530 --> 17:37.560
I made sure it won't open.

17:37.560 --> 17:38.870
But why?

17:38.870 --> 17:41.160
So Your Highness can't get in.

17:41.160 --> 17:45.020
Maria, you will be removing that. Understood?

17:45.020 --> 17:46.920
Yes, as you wish.

17:46.920 --> 17:48.100
Wuh?!

17:48.100 --> 17:49.040
Lettie...

17:49.040 --> 17:49.790
Hmm?

17:49.790 --> 17:51.970
Later. See you tonight.

17:55.310 --> 17:56.720
Give me a break.

17:57.150 --> 17:57.970
Huh?

17:57.970 --> 18:01.350
Like I said, Prince Clarke's 
idea of bonding is awfu—

18:01.350 --> 18:05.340
You don't need to tell me twice. 
Don't make such a commotion about it.

18:05.340 --> 18:08.000
But I'm not accustomed to this at all!

18:08.000 --> 18:09.590
I'd be upset if you were.

18:09.590 --> 18:13.240
He's getting all frisky without 
a single thought for how I feel!

18:13.730 --> 18:16.970
What's wrong with someone 
wanting to be close to their betrothed?

18:16.970 --> 18:21.130
He thinks it's funny because 
I'm not used to it. It's awful.

18:21.130 --> 18:22.120
Look here...

18:22.410 --> 18:26.630
For your darling sister's sake, you need 
to figure out something to do about this.

18:26.630 --> 18:29.980
And here I thought you didn't want my input.

18:29.980 --> 18:32.500
Sheesh. You just say whatever suits you.

18:32.500 --> 18:34.460
Come on, what should I do?

18:34.460 --> 18:37.050
Why don't you just tell him "no" directly?

18:37.700 --> 18:40.180
I did, but he won't listen.

18:40.630 --> 18:42.430
You have to do more than just say it.

18:42.430 --> 18:43.550
Huh?

18:52.190 --> 18:53.630
Prince Clarke.

18:53.630 --> 18:57.660
Lettie! You were waiting for me, weren't you?
I really wanted to see you!

18:57.660 --> 18:59.210
Stop right there.

18:59.210 --> 19:00.040
Huh?

19:00.490 --> 19:01.910
What's the matter?

19:01.910 --> 19:06.130
Your Highness, you've been 
a little too touchy-feely with me.

19:06.130 --> 19:07.920
But that's normal when you're engaged!

19:08.340 --> 19:11.300
There's nothing normal about it to me.

19:12.400 --> 19:14.670
I wanna touch you because I like you so much!

19:15.070 --> 19:16.180
You may not.

19:16.890 --> 19:17.950
Lettie...

19:19.510 --> 19:23.870
If you ever try to approach me 
that brazenly again,

19:24.380 --> 19:28.900
I swear I shall never speak your 
name again so long as I live!

19:28.900 --> 19:30.400
Huh?!

19:34.650 --> 19:37.070
Then what am I supposed to do?

19:37.070 --> 19:40.880
Tell Prince Clarke that you'll 
never speak his name again.

19:41.240 --> 19:43.580
He'll definitely agree 
to your conditions then.

19:43.580 --> 19:45.580
That's all I have to do?

19:45.580 --> 19:49.580
Yes. But be strict. 
You must tell him with conviction.

19:49.950 --> 19:53.030
If he doesn't realize that you're serious, 
then there's no point.

19:56.770 --> 19:58.130
So long as you live?

19:58.490 --> 20:01.130
You won't speak my name 
for the rest of your days?

20:01.130 --> 20:04.140
I couldn't take that! 
I wouldn't be able to handle it!

20:04.140 --> 20:06.430
Ah, I want to hear you say my name!

20:07.350 --> 20:10.440
Thanks! I can always count on you, Brother.

20:10.920 --> 20:14.880
Fine, Lettie. 
Then please excuse me for tonight.

20:17.000 --> 20:21.180
Oh, and next time, be sure to inform me 
before you visit my room, okay?

20:22.860 --> 20:23.690
La, la!

20:25.450 --> 20:28.290
Ah, this is so relaxing!

20:28.290 --> 20:32.980
So you made him promise 
to stop the physical affection?

20:32.980 --> 20:38.410
Yup! I even told him to make sure he lets
 me know before coming into my room.

20:38.410 --> 20:40.050
And how did he respond to that?

20:40.570 --> 20:43.710
"Fine, Lettie..." Like that!

20:43.710 --> 20:47.640
I totally won! I've never been 
so grateful to my brother!

20:48.000 --> 20:50.330
I almost feel sorry for him.

20:50.330 --> 20:53.370
I never thought it would be this effective!

20:53.370 --> 20:57.080
That's only because of how much 
the prince cares for you!

20:57.080 --> 20:59.510
Even when he's making moves 
he knows I don't like?

20:59.510 --> 21:02.820
You can't tell him not to flirt 
with you. It's cruel, even!

21:02.820 --> 21:03.990
How so?

21:03.990 --> 21:08.370
How can you make someone 
fall for you without making the effort?

21:09.070 --> 21:10.250
I don't know.

21:11.180 --> 21:15.250
You're both making this a lot 
more difficult than it needs to be.

21:15.600 --> 21:17.660
I'm not the one making things difficult!

21:17.660 --> 21:19.020
Sure, sure.

21:19.020 --> 21:20.140
Missus.

21:21.230 --> 21:24.220
Prince Clarke has sent his visitation plans.

21:28.590 --> 21:31.140
Why are there visits on so many days?

21:31.140 --> 21:32.780
It seems to be every night.

21:32.780 --> 21:35.210
You're kidding me! I absolutely refuse!

21:35.210 --> 21:38.230
But he really did honor 
your request, didn't he?

21:39.280 --> 21:42.480
You're going to have to get 
everything ready to welcome him.

21:42.480 --> 21:44.680
I would be pleased to assist you, missus.

21:44.680 --> 21:49.950
Why didn't I think of limiting 
the number of visits?!

23:19.920 --> 23:39.940
<b>Next Time</b>

23:20.040 --> 23:25.050
The sky is shedding tears for me

23:20.920 --> 23:25.930
Who the heck is this?

23:21.920 --> 23:26.930
Return her to the castle at once! 
This is going to cause huge problems!

23:22.920 --> 23:27.930
The prince's...

23:23.920 --> 23:28.930
Fiancée...

23:25.930 --> 23:30.930
The prince of Delbaran?!

23:27.300 --> 23:32.310
Lettie, how could you possibly spend the night with another man?

23:28.800 --> 23:33.810
I simply adore myself

23:30.300 --> 23:35.350
I'll make you marry no matter what

23:31.810 --> 23:36.810
Ma! Ri! A!

23:37.270 --> 23:39.940
Smells like a path to freedom
